      "reason": "GFDL-ESM4 is provided as `gr` conservatively regridded to 1 degree while CESM2 and MPI-ESM1-2-LR are native-grid `gn`, which affects masks and which operations are exact in the comparison.",
      "status": "condensed",
      "notes": [
        "GFDL-ESM4 `thetao` is `gr` — already remapped to a 180x360 1° grid — so its \"native-grid\" numbers are archive-grid numbers; CESM2 (~100 km) and MPI (~250 km) differ in resolution by ~2.5, so features narrower than the coarse grid are not comparable in amplitude."
